#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:5817
msgid ""
"The \"vX.Y\" specifies the major X and minor Y version number of the AMDGPU "
"extensions used in the DWARF of this index. The version number conforms to "
"[{ref}`SEMVER <semver>`]."
